;; The native open-world render pipelines as data, single-sourced with the
;; Rust `PIPELINE_SPECS` const in `kami-render/src/pipeline_specs.rs`
;; (itself GENERATED by `bb gen-pipeline-specs` from kami.pipelines/native-pipelines).
;; Ported verbatim as data — this table has no wgpu dependency, it's the
;; per-scene-pipeline cull/depth/blend policy.
;;
;; Datomic/Datascript tx-data: one entity per pipeline (`:db/id -1..-8`),
;; attrs namespaced `:kotoba.render.pipeline-specs/*`. Loaded by
;; `kotoba.render.pipeline-specs/pipeline-specs`, which reconstitutes the
;; original bare-keyed maps (`:name`/`:shader`/`:cull`/...) for callers.
